<title>HONG KONG: ASM Pacific 1996 net down 34 percent.</title>
<headline>ASM Pacific 1996 net down 34 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   54.4     vs  82.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    19.5     vs  25.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    201.5    vs  305.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,357.13 vs  1,566.45</p>
<p>    Company name		 ASM Pacific Technology Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 23-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 30</p>
<p>NOTE - ASM Pacific is a semiconductor manufacturer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 26.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 7.0 cents) vs 32.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
